@HomebrewApp_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

GET {{HomebrewApp_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{HomebrewApp_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/brewable
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{HomebrewApp_HostAddress}}/api/batches
Accept: application/json

### Create a batch: writes a real batch to the stack (delete trial batches afterwards)
POST {{HomebrewApp_HostAddress}}/api/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipeId": 1489,
  "name": "Trial 1",
  "brewDate": "2026-12-05"
}

### Missing fields: 400 with a message per field
POST {{HomebrewApp_HostAddress}}/api/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Recipe without a process: 400
POST {{HomebrewApp_HostAddress}}/api/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipeId": 163,
  "name": "Trial",
  "brewDate": "2026-12-05"
}

### Unknown recipe: 404
POST {{HomebrewApp_HostAddress}}/api/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipeId": 999999,
  "name": "Trial",
  "brewDate": "2026-12-05"
}
